  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HoverTooltipTrigger
  title: Off- Grid inverter
  description: An off-grid inverter is an essential component of off-grid renewable
    energy systems. It is designed to convert the DC electricity produced by sources
    such as solar panels, wind turbines, or batteries into AC electricity suitable
    for powering common household appliances and electrical devices. In off-grid
    systems, where there is no access to a utility power grid, the off-grid inverter
    is responsible for transforming the stored or generated DC energy into AC power.
