  m_text: " As soon as you connect the AC input, wait for a while (5sec) until you
    hear a (Tick) sound from the off -grid inverter, this means that the inverter
    starts the conversion. You will notice that the battery begins to charge and
    the current sign becomes positive \u201C+\u201D. The AC input (grid) and the
    PVs input are sharing with each other\r\nto supply the whole system with power
    as supplying the AC load, DC load and charging the battery.\r"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b04f3173f946b754db673ac13842f4c1, type: 2}
